## What is this?

This directory contains the First Principles Framework specification split into
individual pattern files for efficient AI-agent consumption. Instead of loading
one ~18 MB monolithic file, agents load only the patterns they need via the
indexes. The Library's working instruction and architectural reference ship
alongside the patterns as reference documents.

