## Usage

See `SKILL.md` for complete agent instructions. The short version:

1. Read `reference/docs/using-fpf.md` when the method's conditions matter.
2. Pick an index in `reference/` (ID, question or keyword).
3. Read the `File` column of the matching row.
4. Load that file, plus the files named under `Builds on` when they matter.

## Rebuilding

```bash
# From repo root:
python skill-maker/src/skillmaker/fpf_update.py            # full update from GitHub
python skill-maker/build.sh                 # build from local FPF-Spec.md
python skill-maker/tests/test_fpf_pipeline.py     # run tests
```

